title: "StrucIQ Beam Damage and Retrofit Dataset"
abstract: "Simulated staged damage, vibration, crack width, corrosion, long-term and retrofit response of simply supported reinforced concrete beams: a 10,000-beam design-space population built with a fibre beam model, strengthening simulated by mechanics, corrosion and sustained-load stages, a fatigue estimate, a measurement layer, benchmarks, and validation against published laboratory tests."
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-29
type: dataset
